x; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 0; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<section style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #333333; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #3f3f3f; text-shadow: none; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" draggable=\"false\" /></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #3f3f3f; text-shadow: none; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light;\">亲爱的游客们：</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #3f3f3f; text-shadow: none; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light;\">为了给您带来更加精彩纷呈的游玩体验，全面提升服务品质。</span><span style=\"color: #e36c09;\"><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"text-shadow: none; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light;\">乐华恒业欢乐世界于2025年11月17日至12月23日，进行一场特别的&ldquo;冬日小憩&rdquo;。</span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #3f3f3f; font-weight: 400; font-family: PingFangSC-Light;\">在此期间，园区将暂停对外开放，进行一系列的维护与升级工作。</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #3f3f3f; text-shadow: none; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light;\">我们将于12</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #3f3f3f; text-shadow: none; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light;\">月24日（周三）开启盛大的双旦狂欢之旅。届时，整个园区将被装扮成梦幻般的冰雪世界，等待与您共享一场前所未有的冬日盛宴。</span></p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #3f3f3f; text-shadow: none; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light;\">如有任何疑问或帮助，欢迎随时拨打游客服务中心热线：</span><span style=\"color: #3f3f3f; font-weight: 400; font-family: PingFangSC-Light;\">029-36398888。</span></p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #3f3f3f; text-shadow: none; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light;\">在此，衷心感谢您一直以来的理解与支持。每次的等待，只为更好的相遇。让我们共同期待，再次相聚在乐华，共创美好回忆。</span></p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; cursor: text; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: #ff0000; text-decoration-thickness: initial; line-height: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: right; font-family: 宋体;\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #3f3f3f; text-shadow: none; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light;\">来源：乐华恒业欢乐世界</span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
